  "notes": [
    "Qty 58 as published: the post says 'If you count carefully, this deck is only 58 cards' (the 'Ships (5)' header lists 6, 'Weapons (3)' lists 2, 'Interupts (15)' lists 14).",
    "Coruscant, Tatooine: Jabba's Palace and the Tatooine docking bay are marked '(SL)' (starting locations); Imperial Arrest Order is marked '(SI)' and the strategy says 'I start with Corusant and ISB ops and ... deploy Imperial Arrest Order', so it is set as the starting Effect.",
    "The second docking bay is posted only as ' Docking Bay' (the strategy mentions 'one of my two docking bays'); which docking bay is not said, so it is kept as posted (UNKNOWN).",
    "Posted 'Tatooine Docking Bay (SL)' dested Tatooine: Docking Bay 94; 'Coruscant (SL)' the Special Edition Dark system; 'Darth Vader w/ Light Saber' Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'Boba Fett (EPP)' the Enhanced Premiere Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'Boba Fett (CC)' Boba Fett (Cloud City); 'Darth Vader, DLOTS' Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Chall Beckan' Chall Bekan; 'Bossk in Bus' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'Slave 1' Slave I; 'Laterak Damage' Lateral Damage; 'Objective ISB Operations/Empire's Sinster Agents' ISB Operations / Empire's Sinister Agents.",
    "The strategy says he plans to add another Mandalorian Armor and probably an Interrupt; not applied."
